  "text": "Here are the summarized instructions for making coffee with a French press:\n\n1. Boil water and let it cool for one minute.\n2. Add one tablespoon of coarsely ground coffee per cup to the French press.\n3. Pour the hot water over the grounds, stir briefly, and place the lid on with the plunger up.\n4. Steep for four minutes.\n5. Slowly press the plunger down.\n6. Serve immediately.\n\nThe bird known for its ability to repeat what you say is the parrot."
